(76, 1, '2026-08-28 06:38:18', '2026-08-28 06:38:18', '<!-- wp:cover {\"url\":\"http://localhost/wordpress/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/logo.jpg\",\"id\":43,\"dimRatio\":50,\"align\":\"none\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-cover\"><img class=\"wp-block-cover__image-background wp-image-43\" alt=\"\" src=\"http://localhost/wordpress/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/logo.jpg\" data-object-fit=\"cover\"/><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-cover__background has-background-dim\"></span><div class=\"wp-block-cover__inner-container\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"fontSize\":\"medium\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-medium-font-size\">Located right in the heart of Barotac Nuevo Public Market (Stall #39), <strong>Batchmate Sweets</strong> is the ultimate destination for dessert lovers, coffee enthusiasts, and students looking for a friendly spot to unwind. We specialize in bringing you premium comfort food, offering a delicious menu of <strong>freshly baked cakes, custom pastries, cookies, and rich brownies</strong> crafted to make every day a little sweeter.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"fontSize\":\"medium\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-medium-font-size\">Pair your favorite treat with our freshly brewed espresso lineup, featuring classic favorites like our <strong>Macchiato, Latte, Mocha, Americano, and Cappuccino</strong>—and don’t forget to elevate your drink with our crowd-favorite <strong>Coffee Jelly</strong> add-on! Beyond our baked goods, we also feature a fun, curated selection of <strong>imported Korean snacks and treats</strong> for you to discover.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"fontSize\":\"medium\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-medium-font-size\">Whether you are dropping by for a quick afternoon caffeine fix, hanging out with your classmates after school, or looking to <strong>order a beautiful custom cake</strong> for your next big celebration, Batchmate Sweets is always ready to serve you with a smile.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div